// register with no hardware side effects, legal to use inside a trap-free
// ROI. Restore it so a value stashed before the handoff survives into the
// vsim phase. (mepc/mcause/mtval/medeleg/mideleg/mip/mie are trap/interrupt
// machinery and satp is paging; those stay unrestored, deferred to the
// L3/L4 envelope work.)
